<Paragraph>Hey y’all,<Br /><Br />Welcome to the Growth Circuit newsletter :) We’re Nick and Lucy, and we’re putting together a shortlist of NYC events for people building things in marketing, growth, and AI.<Br /><Br />Expect public talks, demos, meetups, and our own gatherings. We’ll tell you why each one looks interesting and how to get in.<Br /><Br /><Link href="https://growthcircuit.club/events?utm_source=loops&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter_welcome">See what’s coming up</Link><Br /><Br />Glad you’re here!<Br />Nick &amp; Lucy</Paragraph>
